      "index": 0,
      "text": "<think>\nI need to add the two numbers 417,344,240 and 880,055,967.\n\nFirst, I'll add the numbers in the hundred millions place: 4 + 8 equals 12. I'll write down 2 and carry over 1 to the next place.\n\nNext, I'll add the ten millions place: 1 + 8 plus the carried-over 1 equals 10. I'll write down 0 and carry over 1.\n\nThen, I'll add the millions place: 7 + 0 plus the carried-over 1 equals 8.\n\nAfter that, I'll add the hundred thousands place: 4 + 5 equals 9.\n\nNext, I'll add the ten thousands place: 3 + 5 equals 8.\n\nThen, I'll add the thousands place: 4 + 6 equals 10. I'll write down 0 and carry over 1.\n\nAfter that, I'll add the hundreds place: 2 + 9 plus the carried-over 1 equals 12. I'll write down 2 and carry over 1.\n\nFinally, I'll add the ones place: 0 + 7 plus the carried-over 1 equals 8.\n\nCombining all these results, the sum of the two numbers is 1,297,400,207.\n</think>\n\n**Solution:**\n\nWe need to find the sum of the two numbers:\n\n\\[\n417,\\!344,\\!240 \\quad \\text{and} \\quad 880,\\!055,\\!967\n\\]\n\nLet's add them step by step:\n\n\\[\n\\begin{array}{r}\n\\phantom{0}417,\\!344,\\!240 \\\\\n+880,\\!055,\\!967 \\\\\n\\hline\n\\end{array}\n\\]\n\n**Step 1:** Add the hundred millions place:\n\n\\[\n4 + 8 = 12 \\quad (\\text{Write } 2, \\text{ carry over } 1)\n\\]\n\n**Step 2:** Add the ten millions place:\n\n\\[\n1 + 8 + 1 (\\text{carried over}) = 10 \\quad (\\text{Write } 0, \\text{ carry over } 1)\n\\]\n\n**Step 3:** Add the millions place:\n\n\\[\n7 + 0 + 1 (\\text{carried over}) = 8\n\\]\n\n**Step 4:** Add the hundred thousands place:\n\n\\[\n4 + 5 = 9\n\\]\n\n**Step 5:** Add the ten thousands place:\n\n\\[\n3 + 5 = 8\n\\]\n\n**Step 6:** Add the thousands place:\n\n\\[\n4 + 6 = 10 \\quad (\\text{Write } 0, \\text{ carry over } 1)\n\\]\n\n**Step 7:** Add the hundreds place:\n\n\\[\n2 + 9 + 1 (\\text{carried over}) = 12 \\quad (\\text{Write } 2, \\text{ carry over } 1)\n\\]\n\n**Step 8:** Add the ones place:\n\n\\[\n0 + 7 + 1 (\\text{carried over}) = 8\n\\]\n\n**Final Sum:**\n\n\\[\n1,\\!297,\\!400,\\!207\n\\]\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{1,\\!297,\\!400,\\!207}\n\\]",
