      "text": "<think>\nFirst, I will write down the two numbers to be added: 891,053,187 and 153,410,476.\n\nNext, I'll align the numbers by their place values to ensure each digit is correctly positioned for addition.\n\nI'll start adding from the rightmost digit, moving left, adding each pair of digits and carrying over any excess to the next higher place value if needed.\n\nI'll continue this process for each digit pair until all numbers have been added together.\n\nFinally, I'll compile the results of each addition step to find the total sum.\n</think>\n\n**Solution:**\n\nWe need to find the sum of the two numbers:\n\n\\[\n891,\\!053,\\!187 \\quad \\text{and} \\quad 153,\\!410,\\!476\n\\]\n\nLet's add them step by step.\n\n\\[\n\\begin{array}{r}\n\\phantom{0}891,\\!053,\\!187 \\\\\n+153,\\!410,\\!476 \\\\\n\\hline\n\\end{array}\n\\]\n\n**Step 1:** Add the units place.\n\n\\[\n7 + 6 = 13 \\quad (\\text{Write down } 3 \\text{ and carry over } 1)\n\\]\n\n**Step 2:** Add the tens place.\n\n\\[\n8 + 7 + 1 (\\text{carried over}) = 16 \\quad (\\text{Write down } 6 \\text{ and carry over } 1)\n\\]\n\n**Step 3:** Add the hundreds place.\n\n\\[\n1 + 0 + 1 (\\text{carried over}) = 2 \\quad (\\text{Write down } 2)\n\\]\n\n**Step 4:** Add the thousands place.\n\n\\[\n9 + 4 = 13 \\quad (\\text{Write down } 3 \\text{ and carry over } 1)\n\\]\n\n**Step 5:** Add the ten-thousands place.\n\n\\[\n3 + 1 + 1 (\\text{carried over}) = 5 \\quad (\\text{Write down } 5)\n\\]\n\n**Step 6:** Add the hundred-thousands place.\n\n\\[\n0 + 3 = 3 \\quad (\\text{Write down } 3)\n\\]\n\n**Step 7:** Add the millions place.\n\n\\[\n5 + 1 = 6 \\quad (\\text{Write down } 6)\n\\]\n\n**Step 8:** Add the ten-millions place.\n\n\\[\n8 + 5 = 13 \\quad (\\text{Write down } 3 \\text{ and carry over } 1)\n\\]\n\n**Step 9:** Add the hundred-millions place.\n\n\\[\n9 + 3 + 1 (\\text{carried over}) = 13 \\quad (\\text{Write down } 3 \\text{ and carry over } 1)\n\\]\n\n**Step 10:** Add the billions place.\n\n\\[\n8 + 1 + 1 (\\text{carried over}) = 10 \\quad (\\text{Write down } 10)\n\\]\n\nPutting it all together:\n\n\\[\n\\begin{array}{r}\n\\phantom{0}891,\\!053,\\!187 \\\\\n+153,\\!410,\\!476 \\\\\n\\hline\n1,\\!044,\\!463,\\!663 \\\\\n\\end{array}\n\\]\n\n**Final Answer:**\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{1,\\!044,\\!463,\\!663}\n\\]",
