  \n     Write down **7**.\n\n3. **Combine All the Results:**\n\n   ```\n     338,712,736\n   + 377,849,524\n   -----------------\n     716,562,260\n   ```\n\n**Final Answer:**\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{716,\\!562,\\!260}\n\\]",
