      "text": "<think>\nI need to add the two numbers: 837,606,260 and 614,136,448.\n\nFirst, I'll add the numbers in each place value starting from the rightmost digit.\n\nStarting with the units place: 0 + 8 equals 8.\n\nMoving to the tens place: 6 + 4 equals 10. I'll write down 0 and carry over 1.\n\nIn the hundreds place: 2 + 3 plus the carried-over 1 equals 6.\n\nContinuing with the thousands place: 6 + 6 equals 12. I'll write down 2 and carry over 1.\n\nIn the ten-thousands place: 0 + 1 plus the carried-over 1 equals 2.\n\nNext, the hundred-thousands place: 7 + 4 equals 11. I'll write down 1 and carry over 1.\n\nIn the millions place: 3 + 1 plus the carried-over 1 equals 5.\n\nFinally, in the ten-millions place: 8 + 6 equals 14. I'll write down 4 and carry over 1.\n\nSince there's a carried-over 1 with no higher place value, I'll add it to the front, making the total sum 451,742,708.\n</think>\n\n**Solution:**\n\nWe need to find the sum of the two numbers:\n\n\\[\n837,\\!606,\\!260 + 614,\\!136,\\!448\n\\]\n\nLet's add them step by step:\n\n\\[\n\\begin{array}{r}\n\\phantom{0}837,\\!606,\\!260 \\\\\n+614,\\!136,\\!448 \\\\\n\\hline\n\\end{array}\n\\]\n\n**Step 1:** Add the units place:\n\n\\[\n0 + 8 = 8\n\\]\n\n**Step 2:** Add the tens place:\n\n\\[\n6 + 4 = 10 \\quad (\\text{Write down } 0 \\text{ and carry over } 1)\n\\]\n\n**Step 3:** Add the hundreds place:\n\n\\[\n2 + 3 + 1 (\\text{carried over}) = 6\n\\]\n\n**Step 4:** Add the thousands place:\n\n\\[\n6 + 6 = 12 \\quad (\\text{Write down } 2 \\text{ and carry over } 1)\n\\]\n\n**Step 5:** Add the ten-thousands place:\n\n\\[\n0 + 1 + 1 (\\text{carried over}) = 2\n\\]\n\n**Step 6:** Add the hundred-thousands place:\n\n\\[\n7 + 4 = 11 \\quad (\\text{Write down } 1 \\text{ and carry over } 1)\n\\]\n\n**Step 7:** Add the millions place:\n\n\\[\n3 + 1 + 1 (\\text{carried over}) = 5\n\\]\n\n**Step 8:** Add the ten-millions place:\n\n\\[\n8 + 6 = 14 \\quad (\\text{Write down } 4 \\text{ and carry over } 1)\n\\]\n\n**Step 9:** Since there's a carried-over \\(1\\) with no higher place value, add it to the front.\n\n\\[\n\\text{Total Sum} = 451,\\!742,\\!708\n\\]\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{451,\\!742,\\!708}\n\\]",
