Step 5:** Add the ten-thousands place:\n\n\\[\n7 + 6 = 13 \\quad (\\text{Write down } 3 \\quad \\text{and carry over } 1)\n\\]\n\n**Step 6:** Add the hundred-thousands place:\n\n\\[\n2 + 4 + 1 = 7\n\\]\n\n**Step 7:** Add the millions place:\n\n\\[\n5 + 9 = 14 \\quad (\\text{Write down } 4 \\quad \\text{and carry over } 1)\n\\]\n\n**Step 8:** Add the ten-millions place:\n\n\\[\n8 + 2 + 1 = 11 \\quad (\\text{Write down } 1 \\quad \\text{and carry over } 1)\n\\]\n\n**Step 9:** Add the hundred-millions place:\n\n\\[\n6 + 9 + 1 = 16 \\quad (\\text{Write down } 6 \\quad \\text{and carry over } 1)\n\\]\n\n**Step 10:** Add the billions place:\n\n\\[\n0 + 9 + 1 = 10 \\quad (\\text{Write down } 10)\n\\]\n\nPutting all the results together:\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{1,\\!648,\\!528,\\!629}\n\\]",
