 millions place.\n\n**Step 7:** Add the millions place:\n\n\\[\n1 + 4 = 5\n\\]\n\\[\n5 + 1 \\ (\\text{carried over}) = 6\n\\]\n\nWrite down **6** and carry over **0** (since there's no carry-over left).\n\n**Step 8:** Add the ten-millions place:\n\n\\[\n2 + 4 = 6\n\\]\n\nWrite down **6**.\n\n**Step 9:** Add the hundred-millions place:\n\n\\[\n0 + 3 = 3\n\\]\n\nWrite down **3**.\n\n**Step 10:** Add the billions place:\n\n\\[\n2 + 4 = 6\n\\]\n\nWrite down **6**.\n\n**Final Sum:**\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{656,\\!341,\\!301}\n\\]",
